	optdepends = ripgrep: fast regex/code searching during codebase exploration
	optdepends = nmap: network port and service scanning
	optdepends = bind: DNS enumeration tools (dig, host, nslookup)
	optdepends = whois: domain registration and network whois lookups
	optdepends = iputils: ICMP reachability checks (ping)
	optdepends = openbsd-netcat: arbitrary TCP/UDP connections and port listening
	optdepends = curl: HTTP requests and API exploration
	optdepends = wget: file retrieval and spidering
	optdepends = jq: JSON filtering and command output transformation
	optdepends = playwright: headless browser automation via Playwright MCP
